-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Acknowledgements (no code copied)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

probes/ios/VelocityRunner implements the subset of WebDriverAgent's HTTP API
(https://github.com/appium/WebDriverAgent) that Velocity's client uses, and
borrows ideas (not code) from WebDriverAgent and Maestro
(https://github.com/mobile-dev-inc/maestro), such as the deep-tree snapshot
recovery depth. At build time Velocity can also clone WebDriverAgent at a
pinned tag and patch it locally; WebDriverAgent is not redistributed.
